// --- Special Situations (nests under History of Present Illness, same
// level as Trauma/Disaster Management/Poisoning/Environmental Injuries) -----
// Three topics: Sexual Assault (Adult/Adolescent), Intimate Partner Violence
// and Abuse, Abuse of the Elderly or Impaired Adult. Topic list follows
// standard emergency-medicine practice generally, not copied from any
// single copyrighted textbook — all field wording is original. Every
// citation points to a free NCBI Bookshelf (NIH) open search. CDSCO Class A,
// by explicit design: no lethality/risk score is calculated anywhere; no
// field auto-flags, auto-diagnoses, or auto-classifies abuse; screening
// questions are captured as raw yes/no/free-text answers only — the app
// never interprets an answer or produces a risk band; the Administrative &
// Referral Overview is a read-only informational reference (workflow steps
// only) that does not drive, gate, or alter any part of the record.

